title: Stage1
---
<<show_character "Instructor">>
Instructor: Good morning Junior, sorry for my tardiness.
Instructor: Are you ready to begin your first day?

<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: Uh, yes
Intern: But what am I supposed to do anyway…
Intern: The jobdesc told me that my job is to “investigate the weather”?

<<show_character "Instructor">>
Instructor: Yes. That is what we do.
Instructor: You see the five screens in front of you
Instructor: Each screen is hooked up into a program that collects meteorological data
Instructor: For today, you will collect cloud data. It is the monitor on the bottom left.
Instructor: Drag the clouds to each folder then submit your findings, easy as that
Instructor: I’ll leave you to it, goodluck Junior

<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: Okay, I have to identify clouds.
===
title: Stage2
---
<<show_character "Instructor">>
Instructor: Good morning junior, ready to start your second day?

<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: Yes, ma’am

<<show_character "Instructor">>
Instructor: Wonderful!
Instructor: So today, on top of identifying clouds, you’ll have to move satellite discs to the correct location.
Instructor: You have what it takes junior, goodluck

<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: Man…
Intern: I wish she wasn’t always in a hurry
Intern: Satellite data should be the rightmost screen

===
title: Stage3
---
<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: She is late again
Intern: I wonder what’s in store for today.

<<show_character "Instructor">>
Instructor: Good morning my lovely junior
Instructor: For today you are going to gather humidity data
Instructor: But our humidity tracker goes haywire easy and we have to recalibrate them all the time
Instructor: You have to click on the broken humidity gauge to fix it

<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: So much for technology…

<<show_character "Instructor">>
Instructor: What did you say?

<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: Erp! Nothing 

<<show_character "Instructor">>
Instructor: If you are good to go then I’ll leave you to it
Instructor: Good luck

<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: And there she goes again…
Intern: Right so the humidity data should be the top left screen
Intern: Better get to work

===
title: Stage4
---
<<show_character "Instructor">>
Instructor: Junior, you are late. I expected better

<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: Ack! 
Intern: I didn’t expect you to come early

<<show_character "Instructor">>
Instructor: I’m disappointed
Instructor: But since you’ve been doing a good job…
Instructor: I’ll let it slide
Instructor: For today, you are going to collect rainfall data. 
Instructor: Pick the gauge that is the most balanced out of the three
Instructor: It’s easy, even a kid could do that
Instructor: Alright, goodluck junior. Toodles

<<show_character "Intern">>
Intern: Of all days she has to come early today, just my luck 
Intern: I gotta do a good job if I wanna stay in this position.
Intern: The rainfall gauge is the rightmost top screen.


